            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Incontinence associated dermatitis is one of the main complications of incontinence. Very painful, it is a well-known risk factor of pressure ulcers. Nurse assistants and nurses are on the frontline for detecting and treating the condition.</AbstractText>
